<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Hello {!Case.Contact},&nbsp;</font><br style=""><br style=""><br style=""><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">In accordance with the terms of the Agreement, we requested a reconciliation of your future receivables to make sure the remittance amount aligned with your actual receivables.&nbsp; You were required to provide us with the last two months of bank statements for your designated account within 5 days of the request.&nbsp;&nbsp;We have not received them within the time allotted and as a result,&nbsp;<strong>you are in breach of the&nbsp;terms of your Agreement.</strong></font><br style=""><br style=""><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">To remedy this breach, we need you to provide the requested bank statements.&nbsp; If we dont receive those immediately the account will escalate.&nbsp;<br><br>We look forward to hear from you.</font><br style=""><br style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Thank you,&nbsp;</span><br style=""><br style="">{!Case.OwnerFullName} |&nbsp;<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">{!Case.OwnerTitle}</font><br style=""><br style=""><span style="background: white;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of</b><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</b><br></span></font><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="background: white;">P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}&nbsp;F: {!User.Fax}<br>E:&nbsp;</span><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">{!Case.OwnerEmail}</font></font><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font></font></div><div><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Email_Thread_ID__c}</span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>